# 9. Security Scenario

## User Report

> "I received an email asking me to verify my Microsoft 365 password. I clicked the link and entered my password."

This should be treated as a potential phishing/security incident.

### Response

1. Follow the organization's incident-response procedure.
2. Determine whether credentials were entered.
3. Escalate to the security team as required.
4. Follow approved account-protection procedures.
5. Document the relevant facts.

### Important

A Help Desk technician should recognize when an ordinary technical-support issue becomes a security incident.

