# 16. Troubleshooting Methodology

Today's complete support process was:

```text
1. Gather Information
        ↓
2. Clarify Symptoms
        ↓
3. Identify Possible Causes
        ↓
4. Select Appropriate Tool
        ↓
5. Collect Evidence
        ↓
6. Identify Likely Cause
        ↓
7. Apply Authorized Fix
        ↓
8. Verify With User
        ↓
9. Document
        ↓
10. Close / Escalate
```

### Core Principle

> **Good IT Support is evidence-based troubleshooting, not guessing.**

